message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "social-media-age-limits: social media age limits by app and country"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Teach Kids Habits"
    website: "https://teachkidshabits.com"
date-released: 2026-10-14
version: "1.0.0"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/imakarov/social-media-age-limits"
url: "https://imakarov.github.io/social-media-age-limits/"
abstract: >-
  Minimum ages stated by major social media and messaging apps in their own terms,
  and national laws on children's access to online services (COPPA, GDPR Article 8
  digital consent ages, the UK Online Safety Act, Australia's under-16 social media
  minimum age, and others). Every row links to a primary source and records the date
  it was checked.
keywords:
  - social media
  - age limits
  - children
  - COPPA
  - GDPR
  - online safety
  - dataset
